This project's full working instructions live in @CLAUDE.md — read it first.

Also required reading before non-trivial changes:

- @README.md — the design brief (scope, brand, section-by-section spec)
- @AGENTS.md — Lovable git constraints
- @src/routes/README.md — TanStack Start file-based routing conventions

Quick facts:

- Package manager is **bun**, not npm. Dev server is on port **8080**.
- Vite config comes from `@lovable.dev/vite-tanstack-config`; it already bundles
  the React plugin, Tailwind, tsconfig paths, Nitro and devtools. Never add them
  manually.
- Tailwind **v4** — theme lives in `src/styles.css`, there is no tailwind.config.js.
- `src/routeTree.gen.ts` is generated. Never edit it by hand.
- External links and business details belong in `src/lib/site.ts`.
- This repo syncs with Lovable: never force-push, rebase, amend or squash
  commits that are already pushed.
